00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:25,360
 When the tissue gets that oxygen, it uses it, but then it produces waste.

63
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:29,800
 And one of the waste products that produces carbon dioxide, now that carbon dioxide needs

64
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:32,000
