75
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:18,200
 So now that oxygen rich blood is going to come back to the left side of the heart.

76
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:23,640
 When it comes to the left side of the heart, it will then get pumped out to the rest of

77
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,640
