00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,640
 left atrium is getting blood back from the lungs.

85
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:58,640
 Get rid of the pulmonary, lungs, systemic, your entire system.

86
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:03,120
 The pumping chambers of the heart are the right ventricle and the left ventricle.

